.L.str.587:
        .asciz  "DOOM keys"
        .size   .L.str.587, 10
        .type   .L.str.588,@object
.L.str.588:
        .asciz  "Move: W and S or the up and down arrows.  Turn: left and right.\nStrafe: A and D, , and . or Alt with the arrows.  Run: Shift.\nFire: F, the left mouse button or Ctrl.  Open, use: E or Space.\nWeapons: 1 to 7.  Map: Tab.  Menu: Esc.\nSave and load: F2 and F3.  Screen size: - and =.  Detail: F5.\nIn the browser Ctrl+W closes the tab: fire with F or the mouse."
        .size   .L.str.588, 356
        .type   .L.str.589,@object
.L.str.589:
        .asciz  "About DOOM"
        .size   .L.str.589, 11
        .type   .L.str.590,@object
.L.str.590:
        .asciz  "DOOM, by id Software (1993), through doomgeneric, the portable\nChocolate Doom by Simon Howard and others, under the GNU GPL 2.\nThe game's levels, pictures and sounds are its IWAD's."
        .size   .L.str.590, 182
        .type   .L.str.591,@object
